{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And he lay down in that place.</b> It should have said 'and he lay down there,' just as it says 'and he lodged there'; but it is an expression of restriction: there he lay down, but the fourteen years that he served in the house of Ever and engaged in Torah he did not lie down, for his father Isaac sent him to learn Torah in the house of Ever fourteen years before he went to Haran, to the house of Laban."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:15:43.721953188Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}